msgid "Small issue with IDEs"
msgstr ""

msgid "We just started the candidate release cycle for 2.0.0.Final."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Feedback is very welcome so if you have a Quarkus app around, please give it "
"a go."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Make sure you update both the BOM version and the Quarkus Maven Plugin "
"version to 2.0.0.CR2."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Also, we only publish the `quarkus-bom` for non-Final releases so make sure "
"you use this BOM and not the `quarkus-universe-bom` for testing."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We noticed a last minute issue with IDEs today related to a new annotation "
"processor we introduced."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The workaround for now is to disable annotation processors in your IDE (that "
"might not work very well if you're using others though)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For instance, for Eclipse users, you can add the `<m2e.apt."
"activation>disabled</m2e.apt.activation>` property in your POM file."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Anyway, this issue shouldn't prevent you from testing your existing "
"applications and will be fixed in our Final release."
msgstr ""

msgid "Migration Guide"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
